<title>NEW ZEALAND: Govt Property completes NZ$50 mln bond issue - ANZ.</title>
<headline>Govt Property completes NZ$50 mln bond issue - ANZ.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>ANZ Bank (NZ) said on Thursday that Government Property Services had completed its NZ$50 million February 15 2001 bond issue.</p>
<p>The bonds have an 8.00 percent coupon and were priced at a margin of 0.85 percent over the underlying New Zealand government bond rate, ANZ said.</p>
<p>The bonds were rate-set at 7.544 percent resulting in an issue yield of 8.394 percent.</p>
<p>ANZ (NZ) is the arranger of the issue.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
